H&H hot melt adhesive film: Will the hot melt film melt in summer?
The melting point of the hot melt film is generally above 90 degrees, and the lower melting point is 80 degrees. Although it is so hot in summer, it is far from reaching a temperature that allows the hot melt film to melt.
