When the Accumulation/Distribution indicator grows, it means accumulation (buying) of a particular security, as the overwhelming share of the sales volume is related to an upward trend of prices.
Divergences between the Accumulation/Distribution indicator and the price of the security indicate the upcoming change of prices.
Thus, if the indicator is growing, and the price of the security is dropping, a turnaround of price should be expected. Calculation
