News - What Type of Hydraulic Oil Is Used for The Jack
What Type of Hydraulic Oil Is Used for The Jack
When we choose hydraulic oil for mechanical floor jack,we mainly consider the following factors:
The hydraulic system has a lot of moving parts need lubrication to prevent the wear of the relative moving surface, especially the high pressure system, the wear resistance of the hydraulic oil requirements are much higher.
Because the hydraulic oil through the pump, valve saving mouth and gap, to experience intense shear action, leading to some of the macromolecular polymer in the oil such as viscosifying agent molecular cracking, into small molecules, the viscosity is reduced, when the viscosity is reduced to a certain degree of oil can not be used, so it requires excellent shear resistance function.
In the process of using hydraulic oil, it is inevitable to touch water and air, as well as acid substances occurring after oxidation, which will rust and corrode the metal and affect the normal operation of the hydraulic system.
In the hydraulic tank, because oil mixed with air bubbles in the oil circulation, not only can reduce the pressure of the system, the lubrication condition is bad, also can produce abnormal noise, vibration, air bubbles also add the area of the oil with air to touch, accelerated the oil oxidation, therefore requires the hydraulic oil has excellent resistance to bubble and air release.
hydraulic mechanical jacks because of the habit of hydraulic oil and sealing material is not good, it will make the sealing material swell, soften or harden to lose the sealing function, so the hydraulic oil and sealing material can be used to each other.
