After the support point is determined, the pressure rod must be inserted into the casing in front of the jack, so as to apply pressure to the jack, and then the other end of the jack will rise.
After installing the pressure rod into the casing and ensuring that the installation is stable, you can press the rod down continuously, so that the end of the jack will slowly rise up through hydraulic action until the weight is pushed to a suitable height. Pressure can be stopped.
? Different brands of jacks have different pressure relief methods, but most of them will have a screw switch, and the jack can be relieved and reset by turning it counterclockwise.
