5 Factors to Help You Succeed in American Schools
Everyone is a leader in some way or another .
Your life experiences make you a better leader .
What is leadership to you and what do you value in a leader ?
A positive action is any action that helps someone to become a better version of themselves .
You are a leader when you influence others to do better things .
How to turn life’s lessons into leadership experience :
Think about all the tough times you have had .
The lessons we learn from our pain are what matters the most .
Challenges allow the opportunity for us to shoot for greatness
Having to grow up in a refugee camp , I did not think of myself as a leader .
I learned how to stand up and share my story with them .
They began to learn the real issue and wanted to know more .
Leadership is about inspiring others to take a positive action to change .
It is through sharing my story that other students in class became more understanding of why refugees come to America .
Soon , I was looked as a leader in class and some students looked up to me .
Leadership is about standing up for what is right and making the world a better place .
Some people were forced to flee their homeland because of civil war or because of ethnic conflicts .
A good leader must treat all the people with respect no matter who they are .
When people are not in unity , incidents such as wars and all sorts of conflicts take place .
What have you accomplished in your life so far ?
When it comes to leadership , we take from our experience what we know and apply those experiences in our tasks and work .
Think about sporting activities you have been involved in .
In sports , you have to work together to accomplish one goal : to win .
When I played soccer in High School , we used to give each other a break and allow others to play .
Lebê, I realized that it is important to think of others .
In similarity to soccer , when a leader allows another person to lead that person is a good leader .
This is a great skill to have when it comes to leadership .
Think about your job .
You might not like your job for many reasons .
But you can always gain leadership lessons from your job .
At work , you can learn a lot of leadership lessons .
Family and friends aim to help us be the best version ourselves .
Caring is one of the most important pieces of good leadership .
Refugees have gone through difficulties and life challenges .
Ji ber vê yekê, it is important for refugees to see their past struggles and challenges not so much as obstacles , but as an opportunity to draw life’s lessons and turn them into leadership experience .
