Everybody is nice and loving, everybody eats every day, but then you come to find out that its different” says Nishimwe.
People perceived me in a way that I had never perceived myself before” says Nishimwe.
I was involved in the after-school program where I would read for forty minutes every day after school.
Tell your story.
You are authentic and you have to communicate that to others.
