The Billy Michal Student Leadership Award
When asked how he manages his time, Nishimwe explains, saying; “I think it’s about balancing your time.
Nishimwe says you have to discipline yourself to do what matters most to you.
Asking for help is not a sign of weakness but a sign of strengths.
I just befriended all the smart kids in class.
