Scan to pay with Visa. A new way to pay with your mobile phone.
Pay on the go with just a few taps. Visa’s QR payment solution makes mobile payments simpler and more secure – so almost anyone with a mobile phone can use it.
Payments are digitally encrypted and require authentication and approval to be completed. That means no transaction can even be initiated unless both you and the merchant agree to it.
Whether you’re grabbing a coffee, paying bills or ordering dinner, Visa’s QR payment solution lets you pay conveniently and securely. Look for the Visa Brand Mark and QR sign in stores, on your bills, in taxi cabs and more.
