Contactless payments are protected by multiple layers of security and accepted by merchants across Cambodia. No more fumbling with cash – for a fast and easy checkout, simply tap to pay where you see
Look for the Contactless Indicator on your credit or debit card to know your card can make contactless payments. Contactless Visa card purchases are easier than ever as more retailers accept contactless payments around the world.
You can tap to pay with your contactless Visa card or payment-enabled device where you see the Contactless Symbol . Start experiencing the speed, simplicity, and security of contactless payments today at merchants that accept contactless payments, including fast food restaurants, supermarket, cinema, petrol station, pharmacies and more.
How do I know if my card is a contactless enabled card?
How do I hold my card or device at the checkout terminal?
Do I actually have to tap my card or device on the checkout terminal? No.
