It is very possible that, on some occasion, you have heard of Institute of Foreign Trade, better known as ICEX. But what is the ICEX?
3 What grants, agreements, scholarships ... do you have
It can even be found in the Second Life game (on the ICEX islands). Regarding its regulation, this is determined by the Royal Decree 1636/2011, of November 14, which approves the Statute of the Public Business Entity Spanish Institute of Foreign Trade (ICEX), where all the regulations that govern the work of this institution are found.
Now that you know what ICEX is, you should know what it is made of. Generally, It has 31 territorial and provincial directorates, as well as more than 100 economic and commercial offices outside of Spain.
Its president is always the Secretary of State for Tourism and Commerce, while it has an Executive Directorate, led by the Executive Vice President; and two General Directorates, the Promotion Directorate and the Information and Investment Directorate.
In addition to the work carried out with companies abroad such as with the Spain brand, the ICEX is also in charge of collaborate with chambers of commerce, with companies and with regional bodies with the aim of promoting the internationalization of Spain and national products. For this reason, it is easy to request advice from companies to internationalize, in workshops or talks to help promote business, or develop internationalization plans.
Design and execute commercial promotion programs. This in order to publicize businesses and products outside of Spain, in foreign markets.
Promote technical training of companies and train professionals. In other words, it becomes an institution where you can learn about internationalization issues in order to be successful if it is done.
Other functions that you can find from ICEX are:
Advise on strategies for companies that want to export or internationalize. This would include training on export and customs issues, as well as the legislation of the countries with which you want to operate.
Investment programs of foreign companies (mainly focused on technology and R&D activities). In this case, it is foreign companies that, through ICEX, decide to invest in Spanish companies to help them with an economic boost to improve their products and / or services, or to make the leap to export and / or internationalization .
Due to the Covid-19 pandemic that began, the ICEX created a new aid plan, the shock plan to support internationalization, with the aim of keeping the exports that were had at that time intact.
In this way, we can say that if you have a company that wants to export or internationalize to other countries, the best thing to do is go to ICEX for advice and to see if you could get any help to make the process legal. , correct and the best possible for the entrepreneur.
